WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.550 line:90%,end
By morning, thousands of red-eyed robots had reached the castle gates.

2
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:10.040 line:90%,end
There are twenty-three of us. And each of us has a power.

3
00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:12.890 line:90%,end
Today we fight for Elyra!

4
00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:15.740 line:90%,end
Mira covered every bridge with ice.

5
00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:19.670 line:90%,end
Mony's shield became a giant dome over the castle.

6
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.410 line:90%,end
The shield is holding! But it won't last long!

7
00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:30.050 line:90%,end
Eray and his crystal creatures turned the ground under the robots into soft sand.

8
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.400 line:90%,end
Welcome to the sandbox, robots! Don't forget to build a castle!

9
00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:39.350 line:90%,end
Nyra and Leon were on the front line, pushing the robots back one by one.

10
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.660 line:90%,end
Leon, the one on your left! I'll take the right!

11
00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.140 line:90%,end
But Sila's giant warship was descending from the sky.

12
00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:51.490 line:90%,end
Elyra is mine! And I'll destroy it along with all of you!

13
00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:55.970 line:90%,end
The ship fired a red beam. Mony's shield cracked.

14
00:00:56.270 --> 00:01:00.110 line:90%,end
At that moment, Pusula glided into the very center of the shield.

15
00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:03.770 line:90%,end
AyShe, don't be afraid. I'm giving all my light to the shield.

16
00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:08.910 line:90%,end
Pusula, no! I can't lose you!

17
00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.670 line:90%,end
Pusula's light merged with the shield.

18
00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:15.450 line:90%,end
The red beam bounced back and struck Sila's ship.

19
00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:19.320 line:90%,end
The ship fell through the clouds, tower and all.

20
00:01:19.370 --> 00:01:21.910 line:90%,end
Sila's scream was lost in the wind.

21
00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:26.450 line:90%,end
One by one, the robots' eyes went dark. The battle was over.

22
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:32.750 line:90%,end
But in AyShe's palm lay Pusula's little sphere, its light almost gone.

23
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.340 line:90%,end
She's not dead. She's just very tired. Give her time.

24
00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:44.220 line:90%,end
And deep in the clouds, where no one could see, a small red light was still blinking.

